      <p begin="00:03.796" end="00:05.919" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, ayy (And this beat from Cash, not from YouTube)</p>

      <p begin="00:05.919" end="00:08.335" ttm:agent="v1">G locks for the team, but we ain't sharin’ lean</p>

