      <p begin="00:11.269" end="00:14.739" ttm:agent="v1">Pretty girl, where you stayin’? Might as well be with me</p>

      <p begin="00:14.739" end="00:17.659" ttm:agent="v1">AMG the S, ******* cowboy in the flesh</p>

      <p begin="00:17.659" end="00:21.106" ttm:agent="v1">Caught up like the rest, but they look up to me</p>

      <p begin="00:21.106" end="00:24.299" ttm:agent="v1">Sincere but it go left, tryna burn the bridge that's left, huh</p>

      <p begin="00:24.299" end="00:29.333" ttm:agent="v1">Treat her like the one, tryna turn me to a two</p>

      <p begin="00:29.333" end="00:31.451" ttm:agent="v1">I don't keep receipts, say that shit, she knows it's true</p>

