      <p begin="00:38.090" end="00:41.285" ttm:agent="v1">Act funny when you ain't into me, hangin’ in my circle too</p>

      <p begin="00:41.285" end="00:44.223" ttm:agent="v1">Miss that ho, I’m raising Hell, break a ho like Memphis Inn</p>

      <p begin="00:44.223" end="00:47.706" ttm:agent="v1">Bentley's talkin’ to myself, Ghazi said it's sendin' help</p>

