      <p begin="00:50.620" end="00:54.368" ttm:agent="v1">I paid three hundred for a line, 'cause they look like they needed help</p>

      <p begin="00:54.368" end="00:57.050" ttm:agent="v1">How you think I’m talkin' down when I'm the one that needed help?</p>

